# F-ENVELOPE — Implementation Plan (work units)

**Goal:** Freeze the universal node envelope schema + fixture corpus.

**Stated deliverables:**
- `sakg/schema/envelope.schema.json` — JSON Schema draft 2020-12, every §4.2 field
- `tests/sakg/fixtures/envelope/{valid,invalid}/*.json` — every field, every status value, every
  §4.2 invariant violation (authored confidence, frequency-based promotion, deleted node)

**Acceptance commands (verbatim, from the goal statement):**

```
A1  uv run python -c "import json,pathlib;json.loads(pathlib.Path('sakg/schema/envelope.schema.json').read_text())"
A2  uv run pytest tests/sakg/test_envelope_schema.py -q
A3  test $(ls tests/sakg/fixtures/envelope/valid/*.json | wc -l) -ge 12
A4  test $(ls tests/sakg/fixtures/envelope/invalid/*.json | wc -l) -ge 8
```

