## 0. Scope call: three enabling artifacts not named in the goal statement

The goal names two deliverables. Executing acceptance command **A2** requires three more files, and
IMPLEMENT should treat them as in scope rather than improvising them:

| Artifact | Why it is unavoidable | Design ref |
|---|---|---|
